10	 * PENDING/PROVISIONING, then a one-time success card once it flips to
11	 * RUNNING. Deliberately built as a pure overlay on TOP of the existing
12	 * server-detail page rather than a new route: the page underneath keeps
13	 * rendering (and keeps refreshing via the existing `<AutoRefresh />`) exactly
14	 * as it always has, so this component only ever needs to react to props that
15	 * are already being recomputed every 5s — no new polling loop, no new server
